From: NovaRocks fixture maintainers
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Treat explicit null storage-table as an ordinary view

Base-Commit: ccb8bc435062171e64bc8b7e5f56e6aed9c5b934
Contract: https://github.com/apache/iceberg/blob/f14886bb4c54d3e292df85161a0250fbb9ae6d12/format/view-spec.md

Local contract correction: missing and null storage-table both mean ordinary view.
Serialize non-null pointers only; malformed non-null identifiers remain errors.
Map invalid request bodies to HTTP 400 at the fixture servlet boundary; preserve real reader I/O failures.

